{title: 240 - Fairest Lord Jesus}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #240 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 240}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Eb]Fair[Cm]est Lord [Fm]Je [Bb][Eb]sus, Ruler [Cm]of [C7]all [Fm]na [Bb][Eb]ture,
[Eb]O[Ab]Thou of [Eb]God [Bb7]and [Eb][Bb7]man [Eb]the [Bb]Son!
[Eb]Thee [Ab]will [Eb]I[C7]cher[Fm]ish, Thee [C7]will [Fm]I[Bb7]hon[Eb]or,
[Eb]Thou [G7]art [Cm]my [Eb7]glo[Fm]ry, [Eb]joy, [Bb7]and [Eb]crown.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Eb][Cm]Fair [Fm]are [Bb]the [Eb]meadows, [Cm][C7]fairer [Fm]still [Bb]the [Eb]woodlands,
[Eb][Ab]robed [Eb]in [Bb7]the [Eb]blooming [Bb7]garb [Eb]of [Bb]spring:
[Eb][Ab]Jesus [Eb]is [C7][Fm]fairer, [C7]Jesus [Fm][Bb7]is [Eb]purer
[Eb][G7]who [Cm]makes [Eb7]the [Fm]woeful [Eb]heart [Bb7]to [Eb]sing.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Eb][Cm]Fair [Fm]is [Bb]the [Eb]sunshine, [Cm][C7]fairer [Fm]still [Bb]the [Eb]moonlight,
[Eb][Ab]and [Eb]all [Bb7]the [Eb][Bb7]twinkling [Eb]starry [Bb]host:
[Eb][Ab]Jesus [Eb]shines [C7][Fm]brighter, [C7]Jesus [Fm][Bb7]shines [Eb]purer
[Eb][G7]than [Cm]all [Eb7]the [Fm]angels [Eb]heaven [Bb7]can [Eb]boast.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Eb][Cm]Beautiful [Fm]Savior! [Bb][Eb]Lord [Cm]of [C7][Fm]all [Bb]the [Eb]nations,
[Eb][Ab]Son [Eb]of [Bb7]God [Eb]and [Bb7]Son [Eb]of [Bb]Man!
[Eb][Ab]Glory [Eb][C7]and [Fm][C7]honor, [Fm][Bb7]praise, [Eb]adoration,
[Eb][G7]now [Cm][Eb7]and [Fm]forevermore [Eb][Bb7]be [Eb]thine!
{end_of_verse}
